// Title: Potential Adplus.EXE Abuse
// Rule ID: 2f869d59-7f6a-4931-992c-cce556ff2d53
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.execution, attack.credential-access, attack.t1003.001
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
